@base = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@token = replace-with-login-token
### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"Admin@123456"}

### Analyze RulesOnly
POST {{base}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"HTTP-DEMO","amount":150000,"currency":"VND","merchant":"Demo Store","category":"grocery","country":"VN","deviceId":"DEVICE-HTTP","ipAddress":"192.0.2.10","mode":"RulesOnly"}

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alerts with server pagination
GET {{base}}/api/transactions?decision=ALERTS&page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Model metrics
GET {{base}}/api/ai/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
